  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖冷却液泄漏防护、海水泄漏防护、化学品误排放防护和环保合规性四个方面，基于SOLAS、MARPOL、CCS规则及厂家指南证据生成工程需求。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="5">
    <Requirement id="ER-P029-01" level="1" requirementType="safety">
      <sysml:Name>冷却液泄漏防护</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>主机冷却水系统应通过管路隔热、密封件选型、泄漏检测和废液收集等措施，减少冷却液泄漏风险。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="inspection" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P029" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-SAFE-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-ENV-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SOLAS-INCL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>冷却液泄漏可能导致主机冷却不足、环境污染及人员烫伤风险。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查图纸确认高温冷却水管路隔热设计满足表面温度&lt;55°C要求，隔热材料耐温≥150°C并设铝皮护套。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>检查管路色标和热警示标识符合ISO 14726和ISO 11684要求。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>检查废冷却液收集系统设计，确保含铬/亚硝酸盐/乙二醇的废液可收集并送岸上设施。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【冷却液泄漏防护】，来自原始需求「减少冷却液泄漏」。E-SUPP-SAFE-001支撑了高温管路隔热和标识要求；E-SUPP-ENV-001支撑了废液禁止排海和收集要求；E-SOLAS-INCL-001支撑了倾斜工况下膨胀水箱液位维持，间接减少泄漏。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
