    <Requirement id="ER-P029-02" level="1" requirementType="redundancy">
      <sysml:Name>海水泄漏防护</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>主机冷却水系统应配置冗余冷却水泵，并设置压力/流量监测和报警，以在泵或管路故障时减少海水泄漏风险。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="review" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P029" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SOLAS-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-CCS-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>单泵故障且无备用将导致冷却中断，可能引发管路破裂和海水泄漏。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查图纸确认冷却水泵不少于两台，一用一备。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>检查报警清单确认设有冷却水低压/低流量报警。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【海水泄漏防护】，来自原始需求「减少海水泄漏」。E-SOLAS-COOL-001和E-CCS-COOL-001均要求冷却水泵冗余配置和报警，间接支撑海水泄漏防护。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
