    <Requirement id="ER-P029-03" level="1" requirementType="environmental_protection">
      <sysml:Name>化学品误排放防护</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>冷却水系统应设置废液收集设施，防止含化学品的冷却水误排入海，并设置标识和操作程序避免误排放。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="review" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P029" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-ENV-001" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SYS-CORR-004" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SYS-CORR-003" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>supported_by_indirect_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>化学品误排入海将违反MARPOL，导致罚款和声誉损失。</RiskIfUnmet>
        <ApplicabilityConstraint>E-SYS-CORR-004和E-SYS-CORR-003基于MAN/Everllence 49/60DF机型，其他厂家和机型应参照各自技术文件确认。</ApplicabilityConstraint>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查系统图确认设有废冷却液收集舱柜或收集水箱。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>检查操作手册确认有化学品误排放预防程序。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>检查标识符合相关标准（如废液容器标识）。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【化学品误排放防护】，来自原始需求「减少化学品误排放风险」。E-SUPP-ENV-001要求含铬/亚硝酸盐/乙二醇的废液禁止排海；E-SYS-CORR-004和E-SYS-CORR-003（MAN/Everllence指南）要求设置收集水箱回收含化学品的冷却水。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
